- page_title "Suppressions"

header.mb-4
  h1.text-2xl.font-bold Suppressed recipients
  p.mt-1.text-sm.text-slate-500.dark:text-slate-400
    | Remote addresses that reported mail from this server as spam through a provider feedback loop (JMRP and friends). Outbound mail to them is bounced back to the sender instead of delivered, protecting the server's sending reputation. Lifting a suppression resumes delivery - do it only when the recipient asked for the mail again.

- if @suppressed_recipients.any?
  .overflow-x-auto.rounded-lg.border.border-slate-200.dark:border-slate-800.bg-white.dark:bg-slate-900
    table.w-full.text-left.text-sm
      thead.border-b.border-slate-200.dark:border-slate-800.text-xs.text-slate-500.dark:text-slate-400
        tr
          th.px-4.py-2 Address
          th.px-4.py-2 Complaints
          th.px-4.py-2 Last complaint
          th.px-4.py-2 Type
          th.px-4.py-2 Reported via
          th.px-4.py-2 First recorded
          th.px-4.py-2
      tbody
        - @suppressed_recipients.each do |suppressed|
          tr.border-b.border-slate-100.dark:border-slate-800.last:border-0
            td.px-4.py-2.whitespace-nowrap= suppressed.email
            td.px-4.py-2.whitespace-nowrap= suppressed.complaints_count
            td.px-4.py-2.whitespace-nowrap.text-slate-500.dark:text-slate-400 title=suppressed.last_complaint_at&.iso8601
              - if suppressed.last_complaint_at
                = "#{time_ago_in_words(suppressed.last_complaint_at)} ago"
              - else
                | -
            td.px-4.py-2.whitespace-nowrap= suppressed.feedback_type
            td.px-4.py-2.max-w-48.truncate.text-xs.text-slate-500.dark:text-slate-400 title=suppressed.reporter
              = suppressed.reporter
            td.px-4.py-2.whitespace-nowrap.text-slate-500.dark:text-slate-400 title=suppressed.created_at.iso8601
              = "#{time_ago_in_words(suppressed.created_at)} ago"
            td.px-4.py-2.text-right
              = button_to "Lift", suppressed_recipient_path(suppressed), method: :delete,
                  class: "inline-block cursor-pointer rounded-md border border-red-200 dark:border-red-900 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-red-700 dark:text-red-400",
                  form: { data: { turbo_confirm: "Lift the suppression of #{suppressed.email}? Outbound mail to them will be attempted again - only do this if they asked for the mail." }, class: "inline-block" }
  = render "shared/pagination", page: @page, pages: @pages, count: @count, noun: "suppressed recipients", url: ->(page) { suppressed_recipients_path(page: page) }
- else
  p.text-sm.text-slate-500.dark:text-slate-400 No suppressed recipients - no feedback-loop complaints have come in.
